 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Management and Rating of Consumption Items (3DX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope items allows the creation, rating, and management of consumption items in a usage-based process. The rating process for consumption items creates priced billable items.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create consumption items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Rate consumption items</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Handle of individual usage records</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Rate of usage records</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中开发票 – 消耗项目管理和评级 (3DX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许在基于用量的流程中创建、评级和管理消耗项目。消耗项目的定价流程会创建已定价的可开票项目。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建消耗项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评级消耗项目</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe29cb32c1f1e49d3a088fc27a12b218d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">单个用量记录的处理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">用量记录费率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
